          "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Prohibited nested conditional**\n\n`_code` uses a nested conditional expression, violating the repository directive prohibiting nested ternaries and requiring explicit conditionals. Expand the recognized-code, missing-value, and unknown-value cases into explicit branches while preserving their evaluation order and results. This repository requirement must be satisfied before merging.\n\n```suggestion\n    if type(value) is str and value in _CODES:\n        return value\n    elif value is None:\n        return None\n    else:\n        return \"other\"\n```\n\n**Rule Used:** Nested ternies are illegal. All logic should be clear and use conditionals. ([source](https://app.greptile.com/hol/-/custom-context?memory=5bc5a84f-7863-4cc9-9d5a-575de0b9b6be))\n\nNote: If this suggestion doesn't match your team's coding style, reply to this and let me know. I'll remember it for next time!\n\n<a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/ide/codex?prompt=IMPORTANT%3A%20Work%20in%20the%20repository%20%22hashgraph-online%2Fhol-guard%22%20on%20the%20existing%20branch%20%22chore%2Fresolve-2797-conflicts%22.%20Checkout%20that%20branch%20%E2%80%94%20do%20NOT%20create%20a%20new%20branch%20or%20open%20a%20new%20PR.%20Push%20your%20changes%20to%20%22chore%2Fresolve-2797-conflicts%22.%0A%0AThis%20is%20a%20comment%20left%20during%20a%20code%20review.%0APath%3A%20ci%2Fnative_runtime%2Fdefault_auto_failure.py%0ALine%3A%20106%0A%0AComment%3A%0A**Prohibited%20nested%20conditional**%0A%0A%60_code%60%20uses%20a%20nested%20conditional%20expression%2C%20violating%20the%20repository%20directive%20prohibiting%20nested%20ternaries%20and%20requiring%20explicit%20conditionals.%20Expand%20the%20recognized-code%2C%20missing-value%2C%20and%20unknown-value%20cases%20into%20explicit%20branches%20while%20preserving%20their%20evaluation%20order%20and%20results.%20This%20repository%20requirement%20must%20be%20satisfied%20before%20merging.%0A%0A%60%60%60suggestion%0A%20%20%20%20if%20type%28value%29%20is%20str%20and%20value%20in%20_CODES%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20value%0A%20%20%20%20elif%20value%20is%20None%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20None%0A%20%20%20%20else%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%22other%22%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A**Rule%20Used%3A**%20Nested%20ternies%20are%20illegal.%20All%20logic%20should%20be%20clear%20and%20use%20conditionals.%20%28%5Bsource%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fapp.greptile.com%2Fhol%2F-%2Fcustom-context%3Fmemory%3D5bc5a84f-7863-4cc9-9d5a-575de0b9b6be%29%29%0A%0A---%0A%0AFor%20each%20issue%20above%2C%20determine%20whether%20it%20is%20valid%20and%20should%20be%20fixed.%20If%20so%2C%20fix%20it%20directly.&repo=hashgraph-online%2Fhol-guard&pr=2974&platform=github\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCodexDark.svg?v=7\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCodex.svg?v=7\"><img alt=\"Fix in Codex\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCodex.svg?v=7\"></picture></a>",
