itory%20requirement%20must%20be%20satisfied%20before%20merging.%0A%0A%60%60%60suggestion%0A%20%20%20%20if%20type%28value%29%20is%20str%20and%20value%20in%20_CODES%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20value%0A%20%20%20%20elif%20value%20is%20None%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20None%0A%20%20%20%20else%3A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%22other%22%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A**Rule%20Used%3A**%20Nested%20ternies%20are%20illegal.%20All%20logic%20should%20be%20clear%20and%20use%20conditionals.%20%28%5Bsource%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fapp.greptile.com%2Fhol%2F-%2Fcustom-context%3Fmemory%3D5bc5a84f-7863-4cc9-9d5a-575de0b9b6be%29%29%0A%0A---%0A%0AFor%20each%20issue%20above%2C%20determine%20whether%20it%20is%20valid%20and%20should%20be%20fixed.%20If%20so%2C%20fix%20it%20directly.&repo=hashgraph-online%2Fhol-guard&pr=2974&platform=github\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCodexDark.svg?v=7\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCodex.svg?v=7\"><img alt=\"Fix in Codex\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCodex.svg?v=7\"></picture></a>",
